{"timestampUtc": "2026-07-12T20:56:46.008691Z", "event": "ai.trip_import.openai.request", "passName": "enhance", "model": "gpt-5.4", "requestTimeoutSeconds": 120.0, "maxRetries": 2, "systemPrompt": "You are enhancing an already-structured trip to make it engaging.\n\nFor each day: write a SHORT, exciting description of just 2-3 sentences that\ncaptures the vibe and the top highlights of the day. Keep it high-level \u2014 do NOT\nput logistics, step-by-step instructions, or practical tips in the day description.\n\nFor each point, stay, and travel: this is where the detail belongs. Write a helpful,\nvivid description that can be a bit longer, covering what to do or expect, practical\ntips, timing guidance, and any useful step-by-step notes. Location descriptions\nstay concise (1-2 sentences).\n\nDo NOT change any factual fields: refs, titles, names, dates, times, types, modes,\nstayTypes, confirmation numbers, or location names. Do NOT add or remove stays,\ntravels, days, points, or locations. Only improve the description fields. Return the\nfull trip in the same structure.", "userPrompt": "Structured trip to enhance:\n\n{\n  \"tripName\": \"Test Honeymoon\",\n  \"startDate\": \"2026-05-10\",\n  \"endDate\": \"2026-05-11\",\n  \"stays\": [\n    {\n      \"ref\": \"cda5e7da-110f-4e37-af83-e2c5f4e95fc0\",\n      \"name\": \"Hotel Goldener Schl\u00fcssel\",\n      \"stayType\": \"hotel\",\n      \"checkIn\": \"2026-05-11T15:00:00\",\n      \"checkOut\": \"2026-05-12T11:00:00\",\n      \"roomType\": null,\n      \"confirmationNumber\": null,\n      \"description\": null,\n      \"locations\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"venue\",\n          \"name\": \"Hotel Goldener Schl\u00fcssel\",\n          \"description\": null,\n          \"link\": null\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"travels\": [\n    {\n      \"ref\": \"ae6567d9-d58d-4fe0-b1b3-d5cd5fc45da6\",\n      \"name\": \"Train to Bern\",\n      \"mode\": \"train\",\n      \"operator\": null,\n      \"vehicleNumber\": null,\n      \"cabinClass\": null,\n      \"departureDateTime\": \"2026-05-11T12:15:00\",\n      \"arrivalDateTime\": \"2026-05-11T13:30:00\",\n      \"confirmationNumber\": null,\n      \"description\": null,\n      \"locations\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"origin\",\n          \"name\": \"Zurich Airport\",\n          \"description\": null,\n          \"link\": null\n        },\n        {\n          \"role\": \"destination\",\n          \"name\": \"Bern\",\n          \"description\": null,\n          \"link\": null\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"days\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"May 11 \u2014 Arrival\",\n      \"date\": \"2026-05-11\",\n      \"description\": \"Short\",\n      \"isAlternate\": false,\n      \"points\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"departure\",\n          \"title\": \"Depart Zurich Airport\",\n          \"stayRef\": null,\n          \"travelRef\": \"ae6567d9-d58d-4fe0-b1b3-d5cd5fc45da6\",\n          \"startDateTime\": \"2026-05-11T12:15:00\",\n          \"endDateTime\": \"2026-05-11T12:15:00\",\n          \"confirmationNumber\": null,\n          \"description\": null,\n          \"locations\": []\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"check-in\",\n          \"title\": \"Check in\",\n          \"stayRef\": \"cda5e7da-110f-4e37-af83-e2c5f4e95fc0\",\n          \"travelRef\": null,\n          \"startDateTime\": \"2026-05-11T15:00:00\",\n          \"endDateTime\": \"2026-05-11T15:30:00\",\n          \"confirmationNumber\": null,\n          \"description\": null,\n          \"locations\": []\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}"}
